      "searchCoverage": "Official Bitbucket Cloud OAuth 2.0 (https://bitbucket.org/site/oauth2/authorize and /access_token), REST 2.0 GET /user, GET /workspaces/{workspace}, GET /repositories/{workspace}/{repository}, Bearer access tokens, Atlassian identity, and dated incident search (Bitbucket Cloud / Atlassian + security breach/incident) reviewed on 2026-09-13. Pinned authTypes are oauth2 only. listAction helper IDs are not visible to the static parser, so list_workspaces/list_repositories are omitted. Official docs also describe API tokens (Basic email+token; app passwords deprecated 2026-06-09) and repository access tokens; those are not the pinned OpenConnector auth shape and are not invented as a native API-key mapping. November 2025 and March 2026 Bitbucket Cloud availability incidents are operational, not a customer-data compromise. ESA December 2025 Jira/Bitbucket report concerned ESA-hosted servers, not Bitbucket Cloud. Data Center CVEs patched in 2024 are not Cloud. No qualifying unresolved Bitbucket Cloud platform compromise identified. This is not a breach-free claim.",
